  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Always hungry for more gore, your brutish foe produces plenty of it! Your femoral artery is shredded at the junction between inner thigh and groin. The severed stump then withdraws into the pelvis, making it almost impossible to find and clamp the spurting vessel. Your world starts graying out at the edges…</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (3), which requires Surgery to remove. If you fail to bleed to death, the leg will still be useless as the major nerves were also severed (see under Amputated Parts).</p>"
